  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">硫與鉀 - 更多火藥</span></strong></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Forge &amp; Fabric</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>- 這個模組在Minecraft中新增了<strong>兩種新方塊</strong>：<em>硫礦</em>和<em>鉀礦</em>。</p><p>- 目的是提供一種<strong><em>原版友好</em></strong>的方式來合成更多火藥。</p><p>- 硫礦會掉落生硫磺。可在主世界和地獄中找到。在地獄的生成率較高。</p><p>- 鉀礦掉落方塊（類似鐵礦），可熔煉成生鉀。僅能在主世界找到。</p><p>- 使用生硫磺和生鉀，就能製作火藥！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fabric版本標記為：<strong>fabric</strong>-branders-sulfurpotass ... .jar</p><p><strong>若無特別標示，則為Forge版本</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wpwxQRH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"419\" height=\"175\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SJt1Os3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qk3R4Gf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XbVMoTk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TOpsxyw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UlguOUk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p>歡迎在任何模組包中使用，但不保證與所有模組相容</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>&nbsp;<strong>瀏覽我的其他模組</strong>：</h4><p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/lamp-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;- 燈方塊 - 就是一個永遠亮著的紅石燈，讓你不用在上面放醜陋的控制桿</a></p><p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/well-fed\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;- 吃飽飽 - 製作更強的食物：透過組合不同食物來合成一個大份量，減少進食次數</a></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/enhanced-mob-spawners\" rel=\"nofollow\">- 強化生怪磚 - 新增收成與從生怪磚中取出生怪蛋的功能</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f318696%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253danders%2540minaemail.se%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f318696%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dWell%2bFed%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LOz2nLA.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f318696%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253danders%2540minaemail.se%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f318696%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dWell%2bFed%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">小費咖啡罐</a> - 支持我和我的模組的最佳方式。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝您遊玩我的模組，也感謝您請喝咖啡！</p>",
